{"id":"05ef806ab27a7169","group":"56","path":"56/56-lem-levy-permutation.md","title":"置换等价保持Lévy提升目标","display":"lem-levy-permutation — 置换等价保持Lévy提升目标","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-lem-levy-permutation","aliases":["56-lem-levy-permutation"],"display":"lem-levy-permutation — 置换等价保持Lévy提升目标","depends_on":["[[56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting]]","[[56-lem-levy-lifting]]","[[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]","[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]"],"source_section":"§8.4 Lemma 8.4.33(i); Definition 8.4.34","source_printed_pages":"351","source_statement_status":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr-and-selected-page-images; explicit-tag-coding-local","source_proof_status":"source-proof-read-and-local-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-lem-levy-permutation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-lem-levy-permutation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-levy-permutation — 置换等价保持Lévy提升目标"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3d6e0e629b7557a3\" href=\"?note=3d6e0e629b7557a3\" title=\"56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting\">56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e1df6cfb55a11bcc\" href=\"?note=e1df6cfb55a11bcc\" title=\"56-lem-levy-lifting\">56-lem-levy-lifting</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"001b6ab17e88507e\" href=\"?note=001b6ab17e88507e\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-permutation\">56-df-proofterm-permutation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§8.4 Lemma 8.4.33(i); Definition 8.4.34"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"351"},{"key":"source_statement_status","html":"compared-to-local-djvu-ocr-and-selected-page-images; explicit-tag-coding-local"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"source-proof-read-and-local-derivation-in-Remark; not-machine-formalized"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3d6e0e629b7557a3\" href=\"?note=3d6e0e629b7557a3\" title=\"56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting\">56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting</a> 与 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"e1df6cfb55a11bcc\" href=\"?note=e1df6cfb55a11bcc\" title=\"56-lem-levy-lifting\">56-lem-levy-lifting</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\">\\(\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R\\)</span> 共源，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\hat s\\in T_R^L\">\\(\\hat s\\in T_R^L\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=S_R(\\phi)=S_R(\\psi)\">\\(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=S_R(\\phi)=S_R(\\psi)\\)</span>。置换等价与具体路径证明项见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"001b6ab17e88507e\" href=\"?note=001b6ab17e88507e\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-permutation\">56-df-proofterm-permutation</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c273fed319bca9e3\" href=\"?note=c273fed319bca9e3\" title=\"56-df-proofterm-embedding\">56-df-proofterm-embedding</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\">\\(\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R\\)</span> 共源，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\approx_R\\psi\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi)\\approx_{R^L}\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\psi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\phi\\approx_R\\psi\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi)\\approx_{R^L}\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\psi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\phi\\approx_R\\psi\\Rightarrow T_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi))=T_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\psi)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\phi\\approx_R\\psi\\Rightarrow T_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi))=T_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\psi)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho))\\simeq_{R^L}\\operatorname{wit}_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho))\\simeq_{R^L}\\operatorname{wit}_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho)\\approx_R\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\eta)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho))=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\eta)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho)\\approx_R\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\eta)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho))=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\eta)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>按置换等价的生成闭包证明第一式。单位、结合和F结构方程的提升仍是相应标记结构方程。I方程先改变左项变量实例；这些归约不动左项函数位标签，所以前后应用的是同一λ<sup>L(ℓ)，标记方程正是I。O方程先应用这条λ</sup>L(ℓ)，再在右项实例中复制、删除或保留同一批提升后的参数证明，标记方程正是O。上下文闭包逐个构造器递归；组合孔后的提升从相同目标继续，已由同端点归纳保证。对对称与传递闭包分别反向与拼接等式即可。因此全部置换生成规则保存等价，而非仅交换两个不相交的普通步。</p>\n<p>标记置换等价保持端点，推出第二式。对具体路径见证按长度归纳：一步标记见证与抽取规则提升一致，零步是Id；两者仅可能因组合括号及单位不同而结构等价，给出第三式。合并得到最后一式。此处只用Labelling Lemma的前向方向，不用Lévy重构、最大性、FFD或needed策略结论，因此可作为needed原书证明路线的独立基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"3d6e0e629b7557a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-lem-levy-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"e1df6cfb55a11bcc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-lem-levy-lifting]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-permutation","status":"resolved","id":"001b6ab17e88507e","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-proofterm-embedding","status":"resolved","id":"c273fed319bca9e3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting","status":"resolved","id":"3d6e0e629b7557a3","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[56-df-levy-proofterm-lifting]] 与 [[56-lem-levy-lifting]]。$\\phi,\\psi\\in\\operatorname{PT}_R$ 共源，$\\hat s\\in T_R^L$ 满足 $\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=S_R(\\phi)=S_R(\\psi)$。置换等价与具体路径证明项见 [[56-df-proofterm-permutation]]、[[56-df-proofterm-embedding]]。$\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 共源，且 $\\operatorname{erase}_L(\\hat s)=\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)$。","embed":false},{"target":"