 s)=\\operatorname{src}(\\rho)=\\operatorname{src}(\\eta)","display":false},{"tex":"\\phi\\approx_R\\psi\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi)\\approx_{R^L}\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\psi).","display":true},{"tex":"\\phi\\approx_R\\psi\\Rightarrow T_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\phi))=T_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\psi)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LPT}_R(\\hat s,\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho))\\simeq_{R^L}\\operatorname{wit}_{R^L}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho)).","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\rho)\\approx_R\\operatorname{wit}_R(\\eta)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\rho))=\\operatorname{tgt}(\\operatorname{LPath}_R(\\hat s,\\eta)).","display":true}],"bytes":2854,"backlinks":[{"id":"70e3cea5c0444e2c","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定正交TRS。$\\rho,\\eta\\in\\mathcal F_R$ 共源，且 $\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\rho))$、$\\mathrm{NF}(T,\\to_R,\\operatorname{tgt}(\\eta))$。$\\operatorname{LevyLift}_R,\\operatorname{LTgt}_R$ 见 [[56-df-levy-lifted-reduction]]；边展开的置换保持见 [[56-prop-edge-expansion-preservation]]，Lévy标记的置换保持见 [[56-lem-levy-permutation]]。共初正规形路径的置换等价见 [[56-cor-normal-form-permutation-equivalence]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-152","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-lem-levy-permutation.md]]"}],"outgoing":["3d6e0e629b7557a3","e1df6cfb55a11bcc","001b6ab17e88507e","c273fed319bca9e3"]}